{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05244","headline":"永泰公主挽歌二首 二 · 吴兢","name":"永泰公主挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舜华徂北渚，宸思结南阳。\n盩绶哀荣备，游轩宠悼彰。\n三川谋远日，八水宅连冈。\n无复秦楼上，吹箫下凤皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴兢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}